        <p>Our October spreadsheet lists <strong>all 193 counties</strong> with projects in ERCOT's queue, plus a <strong>September-to-October comparison</strong> showing every county's change in projects, megawatts and rank. The September data is included too.</p>
        <p><strong>It's free when you sign up for the Power Grab TX Morning Briefing</strong>, our weekday summary of the Texas data center and grid news that matters.</p>
