          <p class="queue-signup-fineprint">Your download link appears right after you subscribe. Weekday mornings, no spam, no ads, unsubscribe anytime.</p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <h2>🧾 Conclusion</h2>
      <p>In September, Texas's generation queue looked like a battery-and-solar story. One month later, gas is gaining fast, and much of it traces back to one company that is already asking a Parker County community to call its project "quiet" and "low-impact." We'll keep tracking the queue as ERCOT publishes each monthly report.</p>
      <p>For more analysis on Texas energy and AI, visit <a href="/">PowerGrabTX.com</a>.</p>

